sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant KFP as KFP API Server (DSP)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant WC as workflow-controller<br/>(namespaced, per DSPA)
    participant Init as argoexec init<br/>(step pod)
    participant Wait as argoexec wait<br/>(step pod)
    participant Agent as argoexec agent<br/>(agent pod)
    participant S3 as Object Store<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HTTP as User HTTP Endpoint<br/>any port
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(monitoring namespaces)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over KFP,S3: Flow 1 - KFP pipeline run execution (RHOAI)
    KFP->>K8s: Create Workflow CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+, SA token
    WC->>K8s: Watch Workflow, create Pods/PDB/ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS/WSS 6443, SA token
    K8s-->>Init: Step pod scheduled
    Init->>S3: Fetch input artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+, access keys from Secret
    S3-->>Init: Artifacts
    Note over Init,Wait: main container runs user code
    Wait->>S3: Upload outputs and logs<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+, access keys from Secret
    Wait->>K8s: Create/patch WorkflowTaskResult<br/>HTTPS/6443, Pod ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>WC: WorkflowTaskResult event
    WC->>K8s: Update Workflow status<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8s-->>KFP: Persistence agent observes status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 225)
    Note over WC,HTTP: Flow 2 - HTTP template execution via agent
    WC->>K8s: Create WorkflowTaskSet + agent Pod<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8s-->>Agent: Agent pod scheduled
    Agent->>HTTP: HTTP template request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, TLS optional (insecureSkipVerify per template)<br/>template-defined headers
    HTTP-->>Agent: Response
    Agent->>K8s: Patch WorkflowTaskSet status<br/>HTTPS/6443, Pod ServiceAccount
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over WC,Prom: Flow 3 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>WC: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/9090, self-signed TLS, no auth<br/>(NetworkPolicy restricted)
    WC-->>Prom: Prometheus/OTel metrics
    end
